step: 6. Document the tasks for each story, including design, development, testing, and deployment steps.
response:
Task ID: 1
Task Title: Design
Related User Story: User Story X
Description: Review the user story and requirements to understand the scope of work. Create a design plan outlining the architecture, components, and functionalities needed to implement the user story. Collaborate with the team to finalize the design and ensure it aligns with the overall project goals.
Acceptance Criteria: Design plan approved by the team and aligns with project goals.
Estimated Effort: 2 days
Dependencies: Clear understanding of user story and requirements.

Task ID: 2
Task Title: Development
Related User Story: User Story X
Description: Set up the development environment and tools needed for coding. Write code to implement the functionalities outlined in the design plan. Test the code as you develop to catch any bugs or issues early on. Collaborate with other team members to integrate your code with the rest of the project.
Acceptance Criteria: Code implements all functionalities outlined in the design plan and integrates successfully with the project.
Estimated Effort: 5 days
Dependencies: Approved design plan.

Task ID: 3
Task Title: Testing
Related User Story: User Story X
Description: Write test cases based on the requirements and expected behavior of the user story. Execute the test cases to ensure the code functions as intended and meets the acceptance criteria. Fix any bugs or issues found during testing and retest to confirm the fixes.
Acceptance Criteria: All test cases pass, and any identified bugs are fixed.
Estimated Effort: 3 days
Dependencies: Completed development tasks.

Task ID: 4
Task Title: Deployment
Related User Story: User Story X
Description: Prepare the code for deployment by packaging it and ensuring all dependencies are included. Deploy the code to the appropriate environment (e.g., staging, production) following the deployment plan. Monitor the deployment for any issues or errors and address them promptly. Conduct post-deployment testing to verify that the code is working correctly in the production environment.
Acceptance Criteria: Code is successfully deployed to the production environment and passes post-deployment testing.
Estimated Effort: 1 day
Dependencies: Completed testing tasks.

