Related User Story: As a user, I want to be able to view and edit my profile information.
Description: Design and implement a user profile page where users can view and update their personal information.
Acceptance Criteria: Users should be able to see their profile details, edit them, and save changes successfully.
Estimated Effort: 3 days
Dependencies: Task ID 001

Task ID: 003
Task Title: Develop Dashboard Functionality
Related User Story: As a user, I want to see a dashboard with relevant information and statistics.
Description: Build a dashboard feature that displays key metrics and data relevant to the user's activities.
Acceptance Criteria: The dashboard should show real-time data updates and be visually appealing and easy to understand.
Estimated Effort: 7 days
Dependencies: Task ID 002

Task ID: 004
Task Title: Implement Data Visualization
Related User Story: As a user, I want to see graphical representations of data on the dashboard.
Description: Integrate data visualization tools to display charts and graphs on the dashboard.
Acceptance Criteria: Users should be able to customize the data displayed and interact with the visualizations.
Estimated Effort: 5 days
Dependencies: Task ID 003

By following this structured approach and outlining each task with specific details, the development plan can be effectively tracked and executed to meet the project requirements.

